            "title": "What is your return and exchange policy?",
            "text": "<p>We offer <strong>exchanges or store credit only</strong> (no refunds) for eligible items within <strong>10 days of delivery</strong>.</p><ul><li><strong>Rings & Custom Orders:</strong> Because most of our rings are custom made-to-size, they are generally final sale.</li><li><strong>The Draped in Time Exception:</strong> For rings in our <strong>Draped in Time</strong> collection, if your original doesn't fit well, we gladly offer a <strong>one-time exchange for the exact same ring in a different size</strong>. This must be requested within 10 days of delivery, and the ring must be undamaged and return with all original packaging.</li></ul><p>To start an exchange, email us at support@efemerajewelry.com. Read our full Return and Exchange Policy here.</p>"
